'''Octillery''' (Japanese: '''オクタン''' ''Okutank'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

