*This card's illustration rare print features {{p|Octillery}}, {{p|Mantine}}, {{p|Remoraid}} and {{p|Horsea}}.
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Mysterious Treasures|Octillery|57}} from the {{TCG|Mysterious Treasures}} expansion.
*{{m|Octazooka}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Octillery}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Crystal}}.

